usage: run_output_matching.py [-h] [--config CONFIG] [--cache-dir CACHE_DIR]
                              [--dataset-cache-dir DATASET_CACHE_DIR]
                              [--allow-model-download]
                              [--validate-batches | --retest-batches | --screen-bilateral | --validate-bilateral | --diagnose-bilateral-rows | --crossfit-rows | --refresh-rows | --audit-row-transfer]
                              [--fit-archive FIT_ARCHIVE] [--all-controls]
                              [--pilot-archive PILOT_ARCHIVE]
                              [--retest-archive RETEST_ARCHIVE]
                              [--screen-run SCREEN_RUN]
                              [--matching-archive MATCHING_ARCHIVE]

Prepare fresh WikiText train documents, run the A100 matching study and
archive its measurements.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG       Pinned original G1 input config in the current
                        checkout
  --cache-dir CACHE_DIR
                        Model cache on this server; explicitly overrides the
                        archived runtime path in a new run
  --dataset-cache-dir DATASET_CACHE_DIR
                        Dataset cache on this server for the new run
  --allow-model-download
                        Allow pinned model/tokenizer downloads into the new
                        server cache
  --validate-batches    Evaluate completed batch fits on independent new
                        documents
  --retest-batches      Confirm the batch algorithm on fresh calibration and
                        evaluation articles for G1
  --screen-bilateral    Compare input-aware and output-only proposals on fit
                        articles at a short grid prefix
  --validate-bilateral  Score the two frozen A100 fits on 32 previously unused
                        articles
  --diagnose-bilateral-rows
                        Measure all first-layer up projection rows on the
                        completed document cohort
  --crossfit-rows       Swap the 64 up projection fit rows and compare both
                        matched grids on new articles
  --refresh-rows        Test a midpoint row switch against both fixed-row
                        grids on new articles
  --audit-row-transfer  Score fitted and unseen rows at six input projections
                        without refitting
  --fit-archive FIT_ARCHIVE
                        Use the original bilateral_angle_screen.zip for frozen
                        bilateral evaluation
  --all-controls        Also measure every matched solver if the parent alone
                        rules out both G1 routes
  --pilot-archive PILOT_ARCHIVE
  --retest-archive RETEST_ARCHIVE
                        Completed grid logs from the bound-stopped A100 retest
  --screen-run SCREEN_RUN
                        Completed fit screen directory; by default find the
                        latest matching run
  --matching-archive MATCHING_ARCHIVE
                        01d measurement archive used in the batch screen
